.TH HYPOT 3M
.SH NAME
hypot, cabs \- euclidean distance
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B "#include <math.h>"
.sp
.B "double hypot(x, y)"
.B "double x, y;"
.sp
.B "double cabs(z)"
.B "struct { double x, y;} z;"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hypot
and
.B cabs
return
.PP
.ce
\fBsqrt(\fIx*x + y*y\fB),\fR
.PP
taking precautions against unwarranted overflows.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
exp(3) for
.B sqrt
.sp
